      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk the \"moderate\" thing is kinda vague for me lol. i just feel like if i'm eating more healthy stuff it's gotta be better right? like if i do a massive green smoothie every morning with all the kale and spinach i can get my nutrients in one go. can't i just do that to get ahead of it?",
