      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A massive green smoothie, while packed with nutrients, could significantly spike your Vitamin K intake, which is a big no-no with warfarin. Consistency is key, not sudden, overwhelming doses of greens. Instead of massive smoothies, try adding a handful of greens to one meal and a smaller portion to another throughout the day. This approach is much safer for maintaining stable blood thinning levels.",
