      "content": "idk i feel like the doctor is just being overly cautious with me. i dont see why a little extra kale would really be that much of a problem since its healthy. if i just take my warfarin at night and do the big smoothie in the morning, wouldnt that work around it? or can i just take an extra pill if i know i had a lot of greens that day?",
